        "fr-extract.jsonl": [
            {
                "entry_id": "8fcc7833-7483-3c1f-8562-110573fbcd25",
                "word": "naïveté",
                "pos": "noun",
                "lang_code": "fr",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "be23bc8e-258d-42a4-b0d1-3b6e4057a63a",
                        "entry_id": "8fcc7833-7483-3c1f-8562-110573fbcd25",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural"
                        ],
                        "form": "naïvetés"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "d0deeb38-ffc3-326a-b678-35053029a8c8",
                        "entry_id": "8fcc7833-7483-3c1f-8562-110573fbcd25",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Ingénuité, simplicité d’une personne qui manifeste naturellement ses opinions et ses sentiments."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "8cd21c8e-ba19-4023-8b69-bd2b4f848a5f",
                                "sense_id": "d0deeb38-ffc3-326a-b678-35053029a8c8",
                                "text": "On ne peut, par exemple, comprendre la conduite de Robespierre quand on le compare aux politiciens d’aujourd’hui ; […] ; quand il lui fallut prendre des résolutions suprêmes et se défendre contre la Convention, il se montra d’une naïveté qui confine à la niaiserie."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "60565827-56f7-4a9b-8eb5-255d936e911d",
                                "sense_id": "d0deeb38-ffc3-326a-b678-35053029a8c8",
                                "text": "Simulait-elle l’espièglerie, la naïveté pour mieux le captiver, le capturer."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "46879ba0-740e-3570-a1f0-cd384b00af52",
                        "entry_id": "8fcc7833-7483-3c1f-8562-110573fbcd25",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Simplicité naturelle et gracieuse avec laquelle une chose est exprimée ou représentée selon la vérité ou la vraisemblance."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "44919e69-689b-47ea-988b-950f24f93874",
                                "sense_id": "46879ba0-740e-3570-a1f0-cd384b00af52",
                                "text": "On a généralement traité Aucassin comme un conte populaire, dont il fallait mettre en lumière la grâce un peu simplette et la naïveté."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "38158153-f7e2-30b9-b329-fdb5437ede13",
                        "entry_id": "8fcc7833-7483-3c1f-8562-110573fbcd25",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Simplicité niaise ou défaut de retenue dans l’expression de sentiments qu’on aurait intérêt à cacher."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "b5a7aafa-0b29-4a21-ba0f-b76b7fe24efb",
                                "sense_id": "38158153-f7e2-30b9-b329-fdb5437ede13",
                                "text": "Son orgueil est d’une naïveté comique, d’une naïveté risible."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "7a15618a-6121-381e-a3b2-7ef0e9e1abfa",
                        "entry_id": "8fcc7833-7483-3c1f-8562-110573fbcd25",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Propos, expressions qui échappent par ignorance."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "31ebb6c8-5ed9-416a-a5cf-6ac3214b9074",
                                "sense_id": "7a15618a-6121-381e-a3b2-7ef0e9e1abfa",
                                "text": "Les jeunes personnes sont sujettes à dire des naïvetés."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "7df8ffe2-69a4-49d2-801e-95bc77667f61",
                        "source_entry_id": "8fcc7833-7483-3c1f-8562-110573fbcd25",
                        "source_sense_description": "Ingénuité d’une personne",
                        "target_lang_word": "Naivität",
                        "target_lang_code": "de",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "Naivität",
                                "target_lang_code": "de",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "90c231ea-ab9e-3293-8a18-f8857fe5ec12",
                                        "entry_id": "e6815682-afdf-3b31-93b5-18479772ef13",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "argloses Vorgehen oder Denkweise ohne Hintergedanken"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "69143402-ab9b-45a7-9405-41ed3497f815",
                                                "sense_id": "90c231ea-ab9e-3293-8a18-f8857fe5ec12",
                                                "text": "„Russell wird man kaum Naivität vorwerfen können.“"
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "c4b19bbd-8dfc-3df6-99cd-0d2163d6a975",
                                        "entry_id": "e6815682-afdf-3b31-93b5-18479772ef13",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Vorgehen oder Denkweise, die von mangelnder Erfahrung und/oder Sachkenntnis zeugt, wodurch Situation nicht angemessen beurteilt werden"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "derogatory"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5e6656c5-584a-44cc-914e-9d57c6f9a712",
                                                "sense_id": "c4b19bbd-8dfc-3df6-99cd-0d2163d6a975",
                                                "text": "Du bist wirklich mit Naivität gesegnet!"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5677d55b-5f78-40a7-93a2-0a0a6f661bf7",
                                                "sense_id": "c4b19bbd-8dfc-3df6-99cd-0d2163d6a975",
                                                "text": "„Kaum hatte er das gesagt, als Fürst Wassilij und Anna Pawlowna sich von ihm abwandten und mit einem Seufzer über seine Naivität einander betrübt ansahen.“"
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"2\""
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "f57788b2-c351-4413-89ab-d049b94dcb44",
                        "source_entry_id": "8fcc7833-7483-3c1f-8562-110573fbcd25",
                        "source_sense_description": "Ingénuité d’une personne",
                        "target_lang_word": "naïveté",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "naïveté",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "f9f033b8-bb05-3bb2-948b-ffc5a5a832ba",
                                        "entry_id": "a4eb08ca-adc6-3940-b820-4709fad7f46e",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Lack of sophistication, experience, judgement or worldliness; artlessness; gullibility; credulity."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d1e0ed4d-de5a-4cce-83df-3241c2c78529",
                                                "sense_id": "f9f033b8-bb05-3bb2-948b-ffc5a5a832ba",
                                                "text": "“You see, I do not know how to pick out any particular part of the diary.” Even while he was speaking an idea dawned upon him, and he said with unconscious simplicity, in a different voice, and with the naïveté of a child: “That’s quite true, upon my honour. Honest Indian!”"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "94acffcb-778d-459e-be09-bcb1fe7b6a27",
                                                "sense_id": "f9f033b8-bb05-3bb2-948b-ffc5a5a832ba",
                                                "text": "Maybe Mr. “Buckley” should know to be more skeptical about what’s dished out to him by popular culture. But apart from that, it’s hard to see how it’s his fault. He simply accepted what the most widely available and accessible sources of information claimed was true. For his naïveté, he was systematically misled and bamboozled."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "14d53ad0-f03b-426f-a719-f48eecb16a33",
                                                "sense_id": "f9f033b8-bb05-3bb2-948b-ffc5a5a832ba",
                                                "text": "In poring over these vile and well-preserved folders full of antisemitica in the Foreign Ministry archives, one senses a naïveté, even earnestness among Sugihara's generation."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "be5f94c0-632d-4fd0-85ea-c186038b68cb",
